#EXTM3U
# IPTV Movies — Hindi / Punjabi / Hindi Dubbed (Marvel + DC khas tor par)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Is file mein movie links daalo — app har 24 ghante GitHub se khud
# refresh kar legi, naya APK lagane ki zaroorat nahi hogi.
# Format (har movie ke liye 2 lines):
#   #EXTINF:-1 group-title="Marvel Hindi Dubbed",Avengers Endgame (2019) [1080p]
#   https://.../...mp4   (ya .m3u8 link)
# Sirf HD links (720p/1080p) — cinema recording wale links mat daalo.
# group-title ye istemal karo: Marvel Hindi Dubbed, DC Hindi Dubbed,
# Bollywood, Punjabi, Hollywood Hindi Dubbed, South Hindi Dubbed
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Abhi is file mein koi movie link nahi hai — jab koi working HD link
# mile to upar wale format mein yahan add kar do.
